WEBVTT

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:02.040
The main underground power has been shut off.

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.770
What?

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:03.110
What are we going to do from now on?

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:05.950
You should ask the union leaders
a question like that.

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:08.050
You misunderstood my question.

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:10.120
I don't think our demands will be
accepted by management

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:12.760
no matter how long we continue to strike.

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:16.390
So, what you're going to do after
we merge with the Normal Police?

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:21.200
I don't know.

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:25.470
I might go back to my parents'
home, and help run the farm.

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:31.740
Someone said, "Excellent policemen
can only be policemen."

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.510
No, it's nothing.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:45.890
Anyway, one business policy has been changed,

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:49.590
so we're easily dumped. Who the
hell do they think we are?

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:52.430
Don't you think something's wrong?

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:53.930
About what?

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:57.630
They've evaded responsibility
for the boomer accidents

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:01.200
by using us as their shield.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.670
Now, they don't care about losing the shield.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:05.680
Even if they transfer their
business to other areas,

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:07.480
it must be something extreme.

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:11.850
They might intend for the Knight
Sabers take care of the boomers.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:15.850
Or they might be controlled by Genom.

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:17.620
No, that's not it.

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:23.350
I meant something's happening.
Happening within Genom.

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:29.030
This is Leon.

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:29.870
Oh, hi, Maria.

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:30.530
What? The chief's daughter?
Oh, hi, Maria.

00:03:30.530 --> 00:03:32.500
What? The chief's daughter?

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:38.100
Hi, Leon. I haven't been able
to contact my father.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:41.040
I was wondering if you knew something?

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:45.340
Nick? I believe he's still in the Totem Pole.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:49.090
He belongs to management even
though he doesn't look like it.

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:54.420
I saw the news, and they said
AD Police HQ has been closed

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:56.790
and all outside communications have been cut.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.660
What?

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.130
That sounds really strange.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:04.770
Private NAVI is not available, so I
thought something was wrong.

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:09.240
It's not an emergency. I was
just curious about it.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:10.830
Well, thanks.

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:14.080
It's time for the news.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:17.710
Since early this morning, the
AD Police have been on strike

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:19.850
as management and the union still can't agree.

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:23.440
With negotiations stalled, this will
probably go on for some time.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:39.040
Are you sure boomers won't pop
out when we open the door?

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:43.710
I closed all the hatches on the
fifth floor, so you'll be okay,

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:45.910
but I don't know how long the walls will hold.

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:47.400
Still nothing, Roland?

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.550
It's open!

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:22.050
You bastard!

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:23.510
Yano!

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:26.720
Hurry!

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.460
Damn!

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:42.970
Chief! Chief, hurry! The walls
won't hold any longer!

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:45.070
Boomers are already on that floor!

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:48.160
Damn! Let's hurry! We'll get
through to her regardless!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:23.410
Report on the current situation,
Nene Romanova.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:26.680
Well, the number of boomers is
approximately two hundred thirty.

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:29.510
They have occupied everything
up through the third floor.

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:31.540
They're still proceeding up the building.

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:34.780
No, don't go that way, Chief!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:05.080
If you hold me tight, I don't
need any more words

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.020
Hold it!

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:10.420
Sorry, one more time.

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:12.390
Shall we take a break?

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:14.020
No, it's okay.

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:15.850
Well, once more.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:20.620
One, two, three, four...

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:33.280
What the hell are these?!

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:35.510
Damn, we're surrounded!

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:49.420
Damn!

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:55.600
Yano!

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:21.290
Are you all right, Chief Yano?

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:23.550
Yeah, I guess.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:27.930
Go through public relations,
and up the east stairs.

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:29.860
I'm going to open that route.

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:35.770
Before we go there, we need weapons now!

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:53.190
Is there a way to contact the
Information Bureau manager?

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:57.690
lmpossible, as long as we
can't lower the firewall.

00:08:57.690 --> 00:08:59.430
How do you lower it?

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:03.060
Internal sensors are already
tracking the intruders.

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:06.100
Until we remove all the intruders,

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:08.500
we can't lower the firewall of this system.

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:10.540
What the hell does that mean?

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.980
What kind of security system is that?

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:15.780
Do you mean the system works by
abandoning us in an emergency?

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.250
That's right.

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:21.850
Imagine a scenario where a
terrorist group infiltrates.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:25.190
The safest thing for the civilians is
to isolate the terrorist group

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:28.420
by cutting all the communications.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.530
I don't think it's just for the civilians.

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:32.960
Of course not. Terrorists could
access the archives

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:36.100
in the Department of Defense from
this system if they wanted to.

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:37.830
As could Genom.

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:39.300
Roland!

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:44.440
Forget it. The only thing clear is,

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:49.180
we won't be able to get out of here
until we destroy them all.

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:50.810
Excuse me, Chief Haruma?

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:52.350
What is it?

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:55.020
If I turn off all the internal sensors,

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:57.290
we'll be able to lower the firewall, won't we?

00:09:57.290 --> 00:10:02.290
No way. The sensors cover each
other. It's how our security works.

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:05.600
We can't just shut all of them off at once.

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:08.800
I've finished shutting down the security sysytem.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:12.330
What did you say?! That system
shouldn't be easy to shut down.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:18.340
I guess we've been using an
incredible girl as an operator.

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:20.710
I'm going to cut the sensors off all at once.

00:10:21.340 --> 00:10:24.910
During that time, I'll be as blind
as you to boomers' movements.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:26.480
Please be aware of that.

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:30.050
After I send an emergency signal,
I will restart the system.

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:31.190
Roger.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:33.350
Okay, all sensors off!

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:36.950
The firewall has been lowered. Emergency call!

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:47.070
No way!

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:49.660
What's going on?

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:53.870
I can't believe that power to
the mainframe is dead.

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:12.430
What's that?

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:20.390
No!

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:32.780
Hey, what's going on, Nene? What's happening?

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:42.990
I guess the information center
has been occupied.

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:44.460
Poor girl...

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:48.490
Well, what'll we do now?

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:52.220
No matter where we wait, we can't
fight them with these weapons!

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:56.640
But the weapons warehouse is in
Building B, or below ground.

00:11:57.240 --> 00:12:01.840
There are also weapons in the
substation at the ninth floor exit.

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:03.540
Four more floors up...

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:12.580
I just remembered I ought to tell
my daughter I won't need dinner.

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:29.600
Good job.

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:37.380
Damn...

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:38.850
Hello, this is Priss.

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:42.910
Oh, I finally got you! Priss,
Nene is in big trouble!

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:01.900
What are you doing?

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:05.540
Sir, I am searching for data.

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:11.850
You won't betray me. Am I right?

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:16.550
Yes. My programming prohibts
any act of treachery

00:13:16.550 --> 00:13:18.490
against the person who registered me.

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:21.580
Then, what is this?

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:26.730
This is a data searching file
which precedes the order.

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:30.530
Is that the best way of wording it that you know?

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:38.170
Now, answer me, who gave you that order?

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:40.180
Your order is contradictory to the other one.

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:43.810
I'm going to ask you again.
Who gave you the order?

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:48.380
I am programmed to be unable
to commit any act of treachery

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:49.910
against the person who registered me.

00:13:56.560 --> 00:14:00.630
I am programmed to be unable
to commit any act of treachery

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:02.220
against the person who registered me.

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:14.370
Not one boomer can betray the chairman.

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:20.250
A naked king protected by dolls. How pathetic!

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:26.160
What the hell?!

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:30.460
Mason brought it back! What an idiot!

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:33.450
Does he really want to become evil?

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:38.830
However, Mason, I guess you forgot one thing.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.930
Here, in this place, I am a god.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:00.790
Mason!

00:15:02.530 --> 00:15:04.290
Mason!

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:07.500
How are you feeling, my dear Galatea?

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:11.400
I'm bored with this book. I want
to read something different.

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:14.670
Sure, I'll bring you a different
one next time I come.

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:17.610
I'm impressed by how quickly
you learned to read.

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:19.100
I have a friend.

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:22.810
A friend that I talk to.

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:25.180
Whom do you talk to?

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:26.220
Mackey!

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:27.680
What?!

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:32.560
Priss!

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:34.460
How the hell did something like this happen?

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:37.030
Galatea's been playing around for a little while.

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:41.300
So, mad boomers stored at
AD Police HQ have revived.

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:42.500
Galatea?

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:46.740
The name of the Sotai. Mason named her.

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:49.140
Mason? Some jerk from Genom?

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:52.210
Then, how are communications with Nene?

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:54.910
Not good. There's no answer.

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:58.380
That's probably because of the
AD Police security system.

00:15:58.380 --> 00:16:00.780
It prevents enemies on the inside
from contacting enemies outside.

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:04.020
Then what are you doing here?!
We're going to rescue her, right?

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:06.850
But we don't have any hard suits!

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:09.720
Even if we had them, I wouldn't wear one!

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:12.060
Priss!

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.360
One more week.

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:19.660
Even if I really hurry, it will take four to five days.

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:22.070
Oh, no.

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:26.380
That's the situation. Let me get back to my work.

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:27.840
Wait!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:29.840
The motoslave.

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:32.050
Can I use it?

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:34.380
But you need to put on your suit to use it!

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:38.150
You can install the adapter for
riding it without a suit, can't you?

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.260
I guess I could.

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:42.720
How long does it take?

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:45.590
Thirty minutes or so.

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:48.030
Please. I'm taking it with me.

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:51.370
No way! Even if it's you,

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:54.600
I don't think you'll be able to operate
a heavy machine like that!

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:56.640
Let's go, Mackey!

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:03.540
Even if it is foolish, I don't
have any other choice.

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:11.290
Mackey...

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:29.160
No!

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:28.120
Anyway, I have to meet the Chief and the others!

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:33.730
Are you all right?!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:35.560
Damn! They're limitless!

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.550
Oh, no!

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:04.460
Yes, something is definitely wrong.

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:07.400
This is a first class alert situation.

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:12.570
Leon! Daley!

00:20:12.570 --> 00:20:13.670
Yo!

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:16.400
Well, I see all of you have already gathered.

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:18.840
What the hell is happening here?

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:22.610
I thought there was an emergency
call. The next second, it was gone.

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:27.970
I guess we need to get in there anyway.

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:40.230
It's her!

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.940
Leon, help me!

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:50.400
Priss!

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:59.650
Next Episode

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:04.240
Damn, how persistent they are!

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:07.080
No matter which direction I look,
boomers, boomers, boomers!

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:10.830
Audiences shouldn't barge onto the stage,

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:13.130
but they didn't hesitate to come
up, and dirty the place.

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:17.250
In this case, the only thing I can
do is to calm them down.

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:20.090
Yes, it'll definitely work if I do it that way.

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:22.680
Next Bubblegum Crisis!
